    "body": "Financial scams often look like legitimate offers. Warning signs include promises of “guaranteed approval”, requests for upfront payments, fake investment schemes and aggressive sales tactics.\n\nAlways verify companies through official websites. Never share personal data through unknown links.\n\nIf something sounds too good to be true—it usually is.\n\nUnderstanding these signals keeps your finances safe."
